 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 40.9,
   "end": 45.4,
   "text": "I got a lot on my mind and all of the time been trying to do right"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.8,
   "end": 50.8,
   "text": "I may have lost a lot of life, but I'm keeping it tight, never give up the fight, no"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.9,
   "end": 53.3,
   "text": "When my life was a wreck"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.3,
   "end": 55.7,
   "text": "When my life was a wreck"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.8,
   "end": 58.2,
   "text": "Got to keep it all in check"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.2,
   "end": 60.5,
   "text": "I keep it all in check"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.7,
   "end": 75.2,
   "text": "Even in the darkest days, got a trail to blaze, gonna stick to my ways"
  },
  {
   "start": 75.3,
   "end": 80.2,
   "text": "I used to be caught in a phase where life was a maze until I saw the sun's rays"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.3,
   "end": 82.8,
   "text": "When your life is a wreck"
  },
  {
   "start": 82.8,
   "end": 85.2,
   "text": "Your life is a wreck"
  },
  {
   "start": 85.2,
   "end": 90.2,
   "text": "You got to take the first step, yeah"
  },
  {
   "start": 90.3,
   "end": 92.7,
   "text": "Whoa-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh"
  },
  {
   "start": 92.7,
   "end": 95.1,
   "text": "Paddling through the waves now"
  },
  {
